1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,280
Space would not freeze you

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,352
into an ice cube.

3
00:00:02,372 --> 00:00:03,262
Not quickly,

4
00:00:03,282 --> 00:00:04,078
anyway.

5
00:00:04,098 --> 00:00:05,695
Even though it's cold out there.

6
00:00:05,715 --> 00:00:07,010
It works like a thermos.

7
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:08,076
With no air to carry

8
00:00:08,076 --> 00:00:08,890
heat away,

9
00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:10,253
you'd cool down slowly.

10
00:00:10,273 --> 00:00:11,797
The bigger danger is the Sun.

11
00:00:11,817 --> 00:00:13,009
Its unfiltered ultraviolet

12
00:00:13,009 --> 00:00:14,162
light would burn your skin

13
00:00:14,162 --> 00:00:15,768
far faster than on any beach.

14
00:00:15,788 --> 00:00:16,955
So believe it or not,
